cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "Running Nemotron-3.5-Lightning-30B on DGX Spark for Local Agentic Workloads"
message: "If you use this setup, methodology, or benchmark wrapper, please cite it as below."
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: "Rawat"
    given-names: "Rajendra Singh"
    affiliation: "cogni.chat"
    orcid: "https://orcid.org/0009-0007-5017-1341"
repository-code: "https://github.com/airawatraj/dgx-spark-nemo-light-agent"
abstract: >-
  A technical implementation and benchmarking suite for running NVIDIA-Nemotron-3.5-Lightning-30B
  on a personal NVIDIA DGX Spark with up to 1M context. This repository documents the
  methodology for achieving optimized local serving via vLLM using NVFP4 quantization,
  DSpark speculative decoding, and tool choice parsing capability.
keywords:
  - "Nemotron 3.5 Lightning"
  - "DGX Spark"
  - "vLLM"
  - "AI Agents"
  - "NVFP4"
  - "Speculative Decoding"
  - "Performance Benchmarking"
license: MIT
version: 1.0.0
date-released: "2026-08-12"
